# openvpn/

This directory must hold:

- `client.ovpn` — your OpenVPN provider configuration
- `proxy-auth.txt` — your VPN provider credentials (user on line 1, password on line 2)

These files are listed in `.gitignore` and MUST NOT be committed.

Squid credentials (HTTP basic auth on the proxy) are managed separately via
`htpasswd` and `squid.conf` — see the main README.
